{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受词有时过于密集、碎片化，尤其短时段里容易顾着追逐不断出现的词而漏掉叙事；Y的完整句子更容易连续读懂。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】把每段心理变化的关键落点直接凸显出来，短句交替感受词也便于快速扫读；更重要的是，感受词按音乐进程出现，让人能感到情绪如何从怀念、抗拒、焦虑逐渐走向接纳，而不是只看到一组情绪标签。Y的完整叙述更流畅，人物动机也交代得清楚，但右栏大量短词同时铺开，容易形成标签堆积，音乐情绪的先后、转折和细腻层次不如X鲜明。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8ceab929-3a20-4a1d-b362-a6d540033cc5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T193322690587Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:34:39.875144+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2d447004a32ee02941457ddd3ac3a87e48e635e067251e5d740552ac0d01669a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee